  "body": "These are all the photos I have of Paul on my phone. Not nearly enough! Still, I look at them with fondness and thank the creepiness that is facial recognition for finding them for me.\n\nI love that Paul started going full-dad mode when Óli was born, especially with photography. He was damn good at it, and it was wonderfully sweet to see him keeping an eye out for the next Kodak Moment. Of course, I lovelovelove the photo magnet we have of the boys and Óli. I included a blooper because it makes me laugh every time I see Jason's expression (Pretty sure Ben had something to do with it and nothing to do with you, Óli!)\n\nMiss you, Paul.\n\nLove,\nArmand",
